OL,3,GNEWSAThe churches welcoming happy
OL,4,A'champers' and bar-goers
OL,5,
OL,6,FKeen campers are being invited to find
OL,7,Fsanctuary in a rural church as
OL,8,Fguardians look for a variety of ways to
OL,9,Fboost the coffers.
OL,11,FChamping, as it has been dubbed, is one
OL,12,Fapproach being used in Norfolk to
OL,13,Fpreserve well-loved but under-utilised
OL,14,Fand costly church buildings, with
OL,15,Fothers becoming cafes, bars, arts and
OL,16,Fantique centres.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
