OL,3,GNEWSAThe churches welcoming happy
OL,4,A'champers' and bar-goers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe medieval St Peter's Church in
OL,7,FHockwold cum Wilton, near Thetford, is
OL,8,Fwelcoming the campers, with the
OL,9,FChurches Conservation Trust saying its
OL,10,Fvisitors "find it a really unique
OL,11,Fexperience".
OL,13,FMeanwhile, at the Grade I-listed St
OL,14,FMichael at Plea Church in Norwich city
OL,15,Fcentre, a piano and jazz bar has just
OL,16,Fopened to a "good reception", according
OL,17,Fto operator John Taylor.
